  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When the oil is hot, fry gnocchi, tossing occasionally, until golden, 6-8 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.\n• TIP: Add extra oil if the gnocchi sticks to the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6ada5a49c635d8ad558/step-58f5c000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic and parsley.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges.\n• Slice flat mushrooms.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6ada5a49c635d8ad558/step-c3e3ec10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return pan to medium-high heat with a good drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients), stirring, until golden brown, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add garlic, parsley and lemon zest and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a bowl and season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6ada5a49c635d8ad558/step-5aa63720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a good drizzle of marinated goat cheese oil.\n• Cook sliced mushrooms and flat mushrooms until browned and softened, 6-8 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6ada5a49c635d8ad558/step-0bd34130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium and stir in light cooking cream, stock concentrate, a good squeeze of lemon juice and a splash of water until combined, 1 minute.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add baby spinach leaves and cooked gnocchi, tossing until wilted and combined. Season generously with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6ada5a49c635d8ad558/step-10102e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide double mushroom gnocchi between bowls.\n• Crumble over goat cheese and top with herby garlic crumb. Serve with remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d6ada5a49c635d8ad558/step-9875fa50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
